              = succeed "," do
                %strong 38
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9781139644136"} doi:10.1017/CBO9781139644136
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.sas.rochester.edu/mth/sites/doug-ravenel/otherpapers/weibel-homv2.pdf"} pdf
          %p and a more systematic modern development of the theory is in sections 8 and 12-18 of
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Masaki+Kashiwara"}> Masaki Kashiwara
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Schapira"} Pierre Schapira
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Categories+and+Sheaves"} Categories and Sheaves
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 332
          %p Non-abelian variants of homological algebra are disussed for instance in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Francis+Borceux"}> Francis Borceux
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dominique+Bourn"} Dominique Bourn
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Borceux-Bourn"} Mal'cev, protomodular, homological and semi-abelian categories
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 566
          %p
            The foundations of the formulation in the broader context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} stable (∞,1)-category
            theory is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stable+Infinity-Categories"} Stable Infinity-Categories
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.arXiv.org/abs/math.CT/0608228"} math.CT/0608228
          %p Other textbooks include
          %ul
            %li
              I. Bucur, A. Deleanu,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Introduction to the theory of categories and functors
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
